criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Adults ≥ 18 years of age;
* Patients admitted to intensive care unit;
* Patients without any preexisting pressure ulcer on admission;
* Capacity to give informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Length of stay less than 24 hours;
* Decline to participate in the study;
* Admission criteria being post-surgery monitoring and/or admission for drug intoxication
* Patients admitted to ICU with a pre-existent sacral pressure ulcer (any stage).
